+# Safety Case Skeleton & HARA Template
+
+Purpose
+- Template for assembling a safety case for an ODD that links hazards, mitigations, verification evidence, residual risks and reviewer notes.
+
+Sections
+1. Scope & ODD
+   - Describe ODD: geography, speeds, weather, road types, operational constraints.
+2. System Description
+   - Components, sensors, ECUs, NPUs, network topology.
+3. HARA (Hazard Analysis & Risk Assessment)
+   - For each hazard: ID, description, severity (ASIL/SEV), contributing causes, mitigations, residual risk.
+   - Example table:
+     - Hazard ID: H001
+     - Description: Uncommanded throttle during autonomous operation
+     - Severity: High
+     - Causes: perception false positive, planner error, actuator failure
+     - Mitigations: voice+button override disabled for high-risk; E-STOP; formal invariant forbids throttle while brake engaged
+     - Evidence: HIL bundle /applache summary /rt_proof.json
+4. Verification & Validation Matrix
+   - Map each mitigations to evidence items and acceptance criteria (HIL run IDs, pofa_report.json path, signed bundles)
